==Strategy==
This stage is an exact copy of [[The Great Escaper]], albeit with higher buffed peons and [[Aku Doge]]s. Thankfully, Ururun isn't buffed and stays the same. Aku Doge possess the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait and has a "[[Shield]]", which is essentially an extra health bar which absorbs damage and blocks all negative effects until it breaks. Each time he gets knocked back, the Shield will regenerate. Use your typical strategy for The Great Escaper, but keep in mind the higher buffs on peons.

